<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/budget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/budget> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Budget" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/budget> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A structured estimate of costs associated with a proposed or funded project, broken into categories (e.g., personnel, overhead, direct program costs)." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/budget> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
