<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/closeout> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#outcomes-and-closeout> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/closeout> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Closeout" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/closeout> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The formal conclusion of a grant award once all funds are disbursed, all reports are submitted and accepted, and all compliance requirements are satisfied." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/closeout> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "outcomes-and-closeout" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/collaborative-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/collaborative-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/collaborative-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Collaborative Fund Arrangement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/collaborative-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-arrangement> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/collaborative-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Philanthropic Arrangement in which multiple funders pool resources into a shared Fund and jointly direct or oversee its grantmaking." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/collaborative-fund-arrangement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
