<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/compliance-requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#compliance-and-reporting> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/compliance-requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compliance Requirement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/compliance-requirement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An obligation attached to an award that the grantee must satisfy to remain in good standing (e.g., timely reporting, allowable use of funds, insurance)." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/compliance-requirement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "compliance-and-reporting" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/consultant> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/consultant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/consultant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Consultant" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/consultant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/consultant> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they provide paid, defined-scope services to an organization without being its employee." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/consultant> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/contractor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/contractor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/contractor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Contractor" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/contractor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/contractor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it is bound by a contract to deliver a specific, defined piece of work for another organization." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/contractor> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/decision> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/decision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#application-and-review> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/decision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Decision" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/decision> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The outcome of the review process for an application: approved, declined, or approved with conditions." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/decision> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "application-and-review" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Donor-Advised Fund Arrangement" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-arrangement> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Philanthropic Arrangement in which a Donor Advisor holds non-binding advisory privileges over grants made from a Donor-Advised Fund." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund-arrangement> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "The specific privileges and limits granted to a donor advisor are set by the sponsoring organization's own policies and by tax law, not by this ontology -- consult counsel before using this model as a compliance reference." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#funding-structure> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Donor-Advised Fund" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/fund> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "DAF" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Fund held by a sponsoring organization, over which a Donor Advisor holds non-binding privileges to recommend grants and investments." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advised-fund> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "Donor-advised funds are subject to specific federal tax rules (e.g., IRC 4966-4967) governing what a donor advisor may and may not direct. This ontology models the general shape of the relationship, not compliance with those rules." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Donor Advisor" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they hold non-binding privileges to recommend grants and investments from a Donor-Advised Fund, typically as the fund's original donor." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor-advisor> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "A donor advisor's privileges are non-binding as a matter of federal tax law, not just convention -- treating a recommendation as a binding instruction can jeopardize the sponsoring organization's tax-exempt status." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Donor" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role a person occupies when they contribute charitable funds to an organization or fund, without necessarily holding advisory privileges over how they are used." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/donor> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
