<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-intermediary-role> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it channels funds between an original funding source and an ultimate grantee, without itself being the original funder or the final recipient." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/funding-intermediary-role> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
