<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-program> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grant Program" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-program> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A funder's standing area of giving (e.g., \"Environmental Justice Grants\"), under which funding opportunities are issued over time." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-program> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "funding-structure" .
