<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#application-and-review> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grant Recommendation" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Donor Advisor's non-binding request that a Donor-Advised Fund make an award to a specific recipient; the fund's sponsoring organization retains final authority to accept or decline it." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "application-and-review" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grant-recommendation> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "A Grant Recommendation's non-binding status is a legal requirement for donor-advised funds under federal tax law, not a design choice -- see Donor-Advised Fund and Donor Advisor." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grantee" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Recipient" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Subrecipient" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it receives and administers grant funding awarded by a funder." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/grantee> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/indirect-cost-rate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
