<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type-permanently-restricted> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type-permanently-restricted> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type-donor-restricted> .
