<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type-temporarily-restricted> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The fund's donor-imposed restriction expires after a specific time or purpose is satisfied." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type-temporarily-restricted> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type-temporarily-restricted> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "temporarily-restricted" .
