<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type-unrestricted> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The fund carries no donor-imposed restriction on its use." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type-unrestricted> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/restriction-type> .
