<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/reference-data/role-status> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Where a Role occupancy currently sits in its own lifecycle, shared by every person-role and organization-role subtype via the role concept's inherited `status` property." .
