<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/administeredBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Philanthropic Arrangement is administered by an Organization, such as a fiscal sponsor or fund administrator." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/administeredBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/philanthropic-arrangement> .
