<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Person plays one or more Person Roles, each a contextual, independently-scoped occupancy rather than a permanent trait -- mirroring how an Organization plays Organization Roles (rel-organization-plays-role). A distinct predicate rather than a shared `playsRole` because the generator requires every relationship predicate to be globally unique (one fixed subject/object concept pair each); broadening `playsRole` into a real Person-or-Organization union predicate is a generator change deferred to when it's actually needed." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personPlaysRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person> .
