<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personRoleAppliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Person Role is scoped to the Organization it was granted within. This is the minimal case needed to make Person Role usable; broadening it to Award, Application, Agreement, and other contexts (matching how Organization Role's own context is broadened) is Phase 3.7 Milestone 2's job -- which will also need to resolve the same predicate-uniqueness constraint noted on personPlaysRole above, likely by generalizing the generator to support a shared predicate across a union of object concepts." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/relations/personRoleAppliesWithin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
