<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-effective-to-not-before-from> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Role occupancy's Effective To, if present, must not be earlier than its Effective From." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-effective-to-not-before-from> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-effective-to-not-before-from> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A role's effective end date must not precede its start date" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-effective-to-not-before-from> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/appliesTo> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
