<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-effective-to-not-before-from> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/appliesTo> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-context-unless-organization-wide> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/BusinessRule> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-context-unless-organization-wide> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Role occupancy should specify what it applies within (via appliesWithin), unless its Scope is explicitly organization-wide -- a role with neither a context nor an organization-wide scope is ambiguous about what it actually governs." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-context-unless-organization-wide> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-context-unless-organization-wide> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A role occupancy should identify its context unless explicitly organization-wide" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-context-unless-organization-wide> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/appliesTo> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-context-unless-organization-wide> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/appliesTo> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-context-unless-organization-wide> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/appliesTo> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-holder> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/BusinessRule> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-holder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An instance of a Person Role must be held by a Person (via playsRole); an instance of an Organization Role must be held by an Organization (via playsRole). A role occupancy with no holder is not a valid occupancy, only a role definition." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-holder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-holder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A role occupancy must identify its role holder" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-holder> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/appliesTo> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-holder> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/appliesTo> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-holder> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/appliesTo> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/rules/rule-role-occupancy-requires-holder> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/appliesTo> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/person> .
