<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/service-provider> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it provides an ongoing operational service to another organization -- broader and less transactional than a single Contractor engagement or Vendor purchase." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/service-provider> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
