<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsored-project> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsored-project> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sponsored Project" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsored-project> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A project or group carrying out charitable activity under a Fiscal Sponsor's legal and administrative umbrella, without being itself an independent Organization." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsored-project> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsored-project> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/legalNote> "Whether a sponsored project's activities, staff, and liabilities legally belong to the fiscal sponsor depends entirely on the specific fiscal sponsorship model in use. This ontology does not distinguish between models -- consult the governing agreement." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsoring-organization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsoring-organization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://github.com/EGovender/commongood-atlas/blob/main/docs/02-core-concepts.md#organizational-entities> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsoring-organization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sponsoring Organization" .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsoring-organization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/organization-role> .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsoring-organization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role an organization occupies when it holds and administers a Fund on behalf of the fund's donor or benefactors, distinct from acting as a Fiscal Sponsor for a specific project." .
<https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/sponsoring-organization> <https://egovender.github.io/commongood-atlas/ontology/category> "organizational-entities" .
